  "prefLabel": "En 1002.31 In-service date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1002.31 “In-service date” means the date on which system modifications, if applicable, are complete and the facility is interconnected to the EDS and has been granted PTO from the utility, even if the facility is not actively operating by that date.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
